            "review_title": "Review at The Garden House",
            "review_text": "antmax62\nHenderson, Nevada16 contributions\n0\nQuick bite to eat near hospital\nSep 2019\nI needed a quick meal for myself and my wife who was in the hospital. I walked outside of the hospital and found this very nice restaurant. I was able to go in and place a quick order of sticky rice, spaghetti, and a fried egg. I had a nice cup of coffee while I waited for the food to be prepared and was boxed and bagged to go quickly. It had a very nice ambiance with lots of plants and water in an open area that had plenty of shade on the warm morning.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 16, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
