            "review_title": "Review at The Garden House",
            "review_text": "Dostheboss\nMelbourne, Australia14 contributions\n0\nBeautiful drinks in a peaceful setting\nJan 2018 • Couples\nWe stopped here for a few drinks. It's on a busy road, but once you are inside you would barely know it. Beautiful little garden with a small bridge and koi in a pond on the premises. We had a few ice blended drinks which were delicious and reasonably priced. They gave us complimentary tea while we were there and the toilets were clean and well appointed. Also have good free wifi (like most cafes in Vietnam). Give it a try!\nRead more\nWritten January 9, 2018",
