            "review_title": "Review at The Garden House",
            "review_text": "MarianneRothwell\nAlbstadt, Germany236 contributions\n0\nNice place with garden but confusing service\nMar 2017 • Friends\nIt's new place. Inside nice open garden with waterfall. Everything very nice made and fresh. Good place to relax in shadow in busy city. \n\nBut service is confusing. Me and my friend asked about tea and they confirmed it's a tea made with tea leaf. Later they're back and informed:\"sorry, it's not a tea, it's just juice mixed with hot water\". I think stuff should know what they are serving. \n\nAlso they just forgot 1 order from my friend. We were only few people in cafe, not busy, I don't how is possible just forget to bring a juice? !\n\nPrice is ok, same like others western cafes.\nRead more\nWritten March 2, 2017",
